  "description": "Core abstractions for QuerySpec: build serializable query specifications (filters, sorts, projections) and apply cross-cutting concerns — auditing, data masking and row-level security, caching, resilience (retry, circuit breaker, rate limiting), and monitoring — without hand-rolling them per query. Pair with QuerySpec.EFCore to translate specifications to LINQ against EF Core.",
